@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api
@session = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_SESSION_ID
@run = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_RUN_ID

### Create a session; copy id into session above
POST {{base}}/sessions
Authorization: Basic developer local-only

### Agent run; use a new key only for an intentionally new request
POST {{base}}/sessions/{{session}}/runs
Authorization: Basic developer local-only
Idempotency-Key: example-request-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Please request an INR 100 credit for ORD-1001","mode":"AGENT"}

### Read pending immutable arguments and current ledger receipts
GET {{base}}/runs/{{run}}
Authorization: Basic reviewer local-only

### Approve only after reviewing the proposal
POST {{base}}/runs/{{run}}/decision
Authorization: Basic reviewer local-only
Content-Type: application/json

{"approve":true,"reason":"Reviewed the synthetic order delay and proposed amount"}

### Deterministic workflow
POST {{base}}/sessions/{{session}}/runs
Authorization: Basic developer local-only
Idempotency-Key: example-status-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Explain the order status","mode":"ORDER_STATUS","orderId":"ORD-1001"}

### Actual SSE proxy; fragments are provisional
POST {{base}}/sessions/{{session}}/runs/stream
Authorization: Basic developer local-only
Idempotency-Key: example-stream-001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"message":"Find ORD-1001","mode":"AGENT"}

### Cancel a run
POST {{base}}/runs/{{run}}/cancel
Authorization: Basic developer local-only
